            <div class="n-md" data-v-c47154f1="">
              <div class="h1" data-v-c47154f1=""># Grimicorn Neon</div>
              <p data-v-c47154f1="">The grim reaper, plugged into the <i data-v-c47154f1="">mains</i>.</p>
              <div class="h2" data-v-c47154f1="">## Philosophy</div>
              <p data-v-c47154f1=""> Near-black base, <b data-v-c47154f1="">neon syntax</b>, everything <i data-v-c47154f1="">turned up to 11</i>. </p>
              <div class="h3" data-v-c47154f1="">### Accent order</div>
              <ul data-v-c47154f1="">
                <li data-v-c47154f1="">Blue → Purple → Teal</li>
                <li data-v-c47154f1="">Green = success, Pink = error</li>
              </ul>
              <div class="h4" data-v-c47154f1="">#### Heading four</div>
              <div class="h5" data-v-c47154f1="">##### Heading five</div>
              <div class="h6" data-v-c47154f1="">###### Heading six</div>
              <blockquote data-v-c47154f1=""> "Loud by default." — <code data-v-c47154f1="">const calm = false</code></blockquote>
              <p data-v-c47154f1=""><a href="#neon-palette" data-v-c47154f1="">Read the full palette →</a></p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section><!-- TOOLS / DOWNLOADS -->
  <section data-v-c47154f1="" id="neon-tools" class="hex-border-1c1c20 border-t px-8 py-20 max-md:px-4">
    <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="mx-auto max-w-[1180px]">
      <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="mb-10 flex flex-wrap items-end justify-between gap-4">
        <div data-v-c47154f1="">
          <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="reveal hex-text-a7a39c mb-3 flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-[0.65rem] tracking-[0.1em] uppercase"><span data-v-c47154f1="" class="n-bar"></span> get the theme </div>
          <h2 data-v-c47154f1="" class="reveal text-fluid-section hex-text-e7e5e4 mb-2 font-mono leading-none font-bold"> Fifteen ports </h2>
          <p data-v-c47154f1="" class="reveal hex-text-a7a39c max-w-[480px] font-mono text-[0.72rem] leading-[1.7]"> Dark-only, one neon file each. Grab one, or take the whole set. </p>
        </div>
        <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="reveal flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3"><a data-v-c47154f1="" href="/grimicorn-neon-themes/grimicorn-palette.md" download="" class="n-btn n-btn-ghost">palette.md</a><a data-v-c47154f1="" href="/grimicorn-neon-themes/grimicorn-neon-themes.zip" download="" class="n-btn n-btn-rainbow hex-rainbow-gradient"> download all (.zip) </a></div>
      </div>
      <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="stagger grid grid-cols-3 gap-5 max-lg:grid-cols-2 max-sm:grid-cols-1">
        <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="n-card group flex flex-col border-t-2 pt-5 hex-border-a855f7">
          <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="mb-2 flex items-start gap-3"><span data-v-c47154f1="" class="n-icon mt-0.5 shrink-0"><svg data-v-c47154f1="" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9 2.5l5 2.8v5.4L9 13.5 4 10.7V5.3z" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><circle cx="9" cy="8" r="1.7"></circle></svg></span>
            <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="min-w-0 flex-1">
              <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2"><span data-v-c47154f1="" class="hex-text-e7e5e4 font-mono text-[0.92rem] font-bold">Claude Code</span><span data-v-c47154f1="" class="n-badge">featured</span></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p data-v-c47154f1="" class="hex-text-a7a39c mb-4 min-h-[2.5rem] font-mono text-[0.66rem] leading-[1.6]">Terminal-agent palette — diffs, prompts, plan &amp; accept modes.</p>
          <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="mb-3 flex gap-2"><a data-v-c47154f1="" href="/grimicorn-neon-themes/claude-code/grimicorn-neon.json" download="grimicorn-neon.json" class="n-file inline-flex min-w-[88px] flex-1 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 rounded-[2px] border px-2 py-2 text-center font-mono text-[0.66rem] no-underline"><svg data-v-c47154f1="" width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
                <path data-v-c47154f1="" d="M6 1v7M6 8L3.5 5.5M6 8l2.5-2.5M2 10.5h8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
              </svg> Neon</a></div>
          <details data-v-c47154f1="" class="mt-auto">
            <summary data-v-c47154f1="" class="n-summary hex-text-75726b cursor-pointer font-mono text-[0.6rem]"><span data-v-c47154f1="" class="n-chevron inline-block">▸</span> install </summary>
            <p data-v-c47154f1="" class="hex-text-a7a39c mt-2 font-mono text-[0.62rem] leading-[1.7]">Drop the JSON into <code>~/.claude/themes/</code>, then select Grimicorn Neon from the theme menu.</p><a data-v-c47154f1="" href="https://docs.anthropic.com/en/docs/claude-code/overview" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="n-link mt-2 inline-block font-mono text-[0.6rem]">docs →</a>
          </details>
        </div>
        <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="n-card group flex flex-col border-t-2 pt-5 hex-border-a855f7">
          <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="mb-2 flex items-start gap-3"><span data-v-c47154f1="" class="n-icon mt-0.5 shrink-0"><svg data-v-c47154f1="" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 3h12v10H3z"></path><path d="M5.5 6.5l2 2-2 2" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M9 10.5h3"></path></svg></span>
            <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="min-w-0 flex-1">
              <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2"><span data-v-c47154f1="" class="hex-text-e7e5e4 font-mono text-[0.92rem] font-bold">Ghostty</span><span data-v-c47154f1="" class="n-badge">featured</span></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p data-v-c47154f1="" class="hex-text-a7a39c mb-4 min-h-[2.5rem] font-mono text-[0.66rem] leading-[1.6]">Terminal config — background, foreground, cursor &amp; the 16-color ANSI palette.</p>
          <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="mb-3 flex gap-2"><a data-v-c47154f1="" href="/grimicorn-neon-themes/ghostty/grimicorn-neon.conf" download="grimicorn-neon.conf" class="n-file inline-flex min-w-[88px] flex-1 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 rounded-[2px] border px-2 py-2 text-center font-mono text-[0.66rem] no-underline"><svg data-v-c47154f1="" width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
                <path data-v-c47154f1="" d="M6 1v7M6 8L3.5 5.5M6 8l2.5-2.5M2 10.5h8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
              </svg> Neon</a></div>
          <details data-v-c47154f1="" class="mt-auto">
            <summary data-v-c47154f1="" class="n-summary hex-text-75726b cursor-pointer font-mono text-[0.6rem]"><span data-v-c47154f1="" class="n-chevron inline-block">▸</span> install </summary>
            <p data-v-c47154f1="" class="hex-text-a7a39c mt-2 font-mono text-[0.62rem] leading-[1.7]">Drop it in <code>~/.config/ghostty/themes/</code> and set <code>theme = grimicorn-neon</code>, or include it with <code>config-file = …</code>.</p><a data-v-c47154f1="" href="https://ghostty.org/docs/config/reference#theme" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="n-link mt-2 inline-block font-mono text-[0.6rem]">docs →</a>
          </details>
        </div>
        <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="n-card group flex flex-col border-t-2 pt-5 hex-border-a855f7">
          <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="mb-2 flex items-start gap-3"><span data-v-c47154f1="" class="n-icon mt-0.5 shrink-0"><svg data-v-c47154f1="" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="5" cy="5" r="1.6"></circle><circle cx="5" cy="13" r="1.6"></circle><circle cx="13" cy="9" r="1.6"></circle><path d="M5 6.6v4.8M6.5 5h4.4a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 1.6 1.6V8"></path></svg></span>
            <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="min-w-0 flex-1">
              <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2"><span data-v-c47154f1="" class="hex-text-e7e5e4 font-mono text-[0.92rem] font-bold">Git Tower</span><span data-v-c47154f1="" class="n-badge">featured</span></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p data-v-c47154f1="" class="hex-text-a7a39c mb-4 min-h-[2.5rem] font-mono text-[0.66rem] leading-[1.6]">Diff &amp; syntax theme for the Tower git client.</p>
          <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="mb-3 flex gap-2"><a data-v-c47154f1="" href="/grimicorn-neon-themes/gittower/Grimicorn-Neon.towertheme" download="Grimicorn Neon.towertheme" class="n-file inline-flex min-w-[88px] flex-1 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 rounded-[2px] border px-2 py-2 text-center font-mono text-[0.66rem] no-underline"><svg data-v-c47154f1="" width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
                <path data-v-c47154f1="" d="M6 1v7M6 8L3.5 5.5M6 8l2.5-2.5M2 10.5h8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
              </svg> Neon</a></div>
          <details data-v-c47154f1="" class="mt-auto">
            <summary data-v-c47154f1="" class="n-summary hex-text-75726b cursor-pointer font-mono text-[0.6rem]"><span data-v-c47154f1="" class="n-chevron inline-block">▸</span> install </summary>
            <p data-v-c47154f1="" class="hex-text-a7a39c mt-2 font-mono text-[0.62rem] leading-[1.7]">Double-click the <code>.towertheme</code> to install, then pick it in Tower → Settings → Git Config / Appearance.</p><a data-v-c47154f1="" href="https://www.git-tower.com/help/guides/integration/syntax-highlighting/mac" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="n-link mt-2 inline-block font-mono text-[0.6rem]">docs →</a>
          </details>
        </div>
        <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="n-card group flex flex-col border-t-2 pt-5 hex-border-a855f7">
          <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="mb-2 flex items-start gap-3"><span data-v-c47154f1="" class="n-icon mt-0.5 shrink-0"><svg data-v-c47154f1="" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 2.5h7L14 6v9.5H4z"></path><path d="M11 2.5V6h3"></path><path d="M6.5 9h5M6.5 11.5h5"></path></svg></span>
            <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="min-w-0 flex-1">
              <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2"><span data-v-c47154f1="" class="hex-text-e7e5e4 font-mono text-[0.92rem] font-bold">Obsidian</span><span data-v-c47154f1="" class="n-badge">featured</span></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p data-v-c47154f1="" class="hex-text-a7a39c mb-4 min-h-[2.5rem] font-mono text-[0.66rem] leading-[1.6]">Vault theme with the full neon heading-color waterfall.</p>
          <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="mb-3 flex gap-2"><a data-v-c47154f1="" href="/grimicorn-neon-themes/obsidian/theme.css" download="theme.css" class="n-file inline-flex min-w-[88px] flex-1 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 rounded-[2px] border px-2 py-2 text-center font-mono text-[0.66rem] no-underline"><svg data-v-c47154f1="" width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
                <path data-v-c47154f1="" d="M6 1v7M6 8L3.5 5.5M6 8l2.5-2.5M2 10.5h8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
              </svg> theme.css</a><a data-v-c47154f1="" href="/grimicorn-neon-themes/obsidian/manifest.json" download="manifest.json" class="n-file inline-flex min-w-[88px] flex-1 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 rounded-[2px] border px-2 py-2 text-center font-mono text-[0.66rem] no-underline"><svg data-v-c47154f1="" width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
                <path data-v-c47154f1="" d="M6 1v7M6 8L3.5 5.5M6 8l2.5-2.5M2 10.5h8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
              </svg> manifest.json</a></div>
          <details data-v-c47154f1="" class="mt-auto">
            <summary data-v-c47154f1="" class="n-summary hex-text-75726b cursor-pointer font-mono text-[0.6rem]"><span data-v-c47154f1="" class="n-chevron inline-block">▸</span> install </summary>
            <p data-v-c47154f1="" class="hex-text-a7a39c mt-2 font-mono text-[0.62rem] leading-[1.7]">Place both files in <code>.obsidian/themes/Grimicorn Neon/</code>, then Settings → Appearance → <em>Grimicorn Neon</em>.</p><a data-v-c47154f1="" href="https://help.obsidian.md/themes" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="n-link mt-2 inline-block font-mono text-[0.6rem]">docs →</a>
          </details>
        </div>
        <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="n-card group flex flex-col border-t-2 pt-5 hex-border-a855f7">
          <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="mb-2 flex items-start gap-3"><span data-v-c47154f1="" class="n-icon mt-0.5 shrink-0"><svg data-v-c47154f1="" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 3h12v10H3z"></path><path d="M5.5 6.5l2 2-2 2" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M9 10.5h3"></path></svg></span>
            <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="min-w-0 flex-1">
              <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2"><span data-v-c47154f1="" class="hex-text-e7e5e4 font-mono text-[0.92rem] font-bold">Panic Prompt</span><span data-v-c47154f1="" class="n-badge">featured</span></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p data-v-c47154f1="" class="hex-text-a7a39c mb-4 min-h-[2.5rem] font-mono text-[0.66rem] leading-[1.6]">Panic's SSH client for Mac &amp; iOS — neon ANSI, cursor &amp; selection, with text glow switched on.</p>
          <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="mb-3 flex gap-2"><a data-v-c47154f1="" href="/grimicorn-neon-themes/prompt/Grimicorn-Neon.promptTheme" download="Grimicorn-Neon.promptTheme" class="n-file inline-flex min-w-[88px] flex-1 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 rounded-[2px] border px-2 py-2 text-center font-mono text-[0.66rem] no-underline"><svg data-v-c47154f1="" width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
                <path data-v-c47154f1="" d="M6 1v7M6 8L3.5 5.5M6 8l2.5-2.5M2 10.5h8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
              </svg> Neon</a></div>
          <details data-v-c47154f1="" class="mt-auto">
            <summary data-v-c47154f1="" class="n-summary hex-text-75726b cursor-pointer font-mono text-[0.6rem]"><span data-v-c47154f1="" class="n-chevron inline-block">▸</span> install </summary>
            <p data-v-c47154f1="" class="hex-text-a7a39c mt-2 font-mono text-[0.62rem] leading-[1.7]">Double-click the <code>.promptTheme</code> to import (or Settings → Themes → ⚙︎ → <em>Import</em>), then pick Grimicorn Neon from the theme list.</p><a data-v-c47154f1="" href="https://help.panic.com/prompt/prompt-themes/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="n-link mt-2 inline-block font-mono text-[0.6rem]">docs →</a>
          </details>
        </div>
        <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="n-card group flex flex-col border-t-2 pt-5 hex-border-a855f7">
          <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="mb-2 flex items-start gap-3"><span data-v-c47154f1="" class="n-icon mt-0.5 shrink-0"><svg data-v-c47154f1="" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 3h12v10H3z"></path><path d="M3 6h12"></path><path d="M5.5 4.5h.01"></path></svg></span>
            <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="min-w-0 flex-1">
              <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2"><span data-v-c47154f1="" class="hex-text-e7e5e4 font-mono text-[0.92rem] font-bold">VS Code</span><span data-v-c47154f1="" class="n-badge">featured</span></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p data-v-c47154f1="" class="hex-text-a7a39c mb-4 min-h-[2.5rem] font-mono text-[0.66rem] leading-[1.6]">Full editor + workbench theme, glowing on near-black.</p>
          <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="mb-3 flex gap-2"><a data-v-c47154f1="" href="/grimicorn-neon-themes/vscode/grimicorn-neon.color-theme.json" download="grimicorn-neon.color-theme.json" class="n-file inline-flex min-w-[88px] flex-1 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 rounded-[2px] border px-2 py-2 text-center font-mono text-[0.66rem] no-underline"><svg data-v-c47154f1="" width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
                <path data-v-c47154f1="" d="M6 1v7M6 8L3.5 5.5M6 8l2.5-2.5M2 10.5h8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
              </svg> Neon</a></div>
          <details data-v-c47154f1="" class="mt-auto">
            <summary data-v-c47154f1="" class="n-summary hex-text-75726b cursor-pointer font-mono text-[0.6rem]"><span data-v-c47154f1="" class="n-chevron inline-block">▸</span> install </summary>
            <p data-v-c47154f1="" class="hex-text-a7a39c mt-2 font-mono text-[0.62rem] leading-[1.7]">Drop the file into a folder with a package.json under <code>~/.vscode/extensions/grimicorn-neon/</code>, reload, then pick Grimicorn Neon in <code>⌘K ⌘T</code>.</p><a data-v-c47154f1="" href="https://code.visualstudio.com/docs/configure/themes" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="n-link mt-2 inline-block font-mono text-[0.6rem]">docs →</a>
          </details>
        </div>
        <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="n-card group flex flex-col border-t-2 pt-5 hex-border-1c1c20">
          <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="mb-2 flex items-start gap-3"><span data-v-c47154f1="" class="n-icon mt-0.5 shrink-0"><svg data-v-c47154f1="" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 3h12v10H3z"></path><path d="M3 6h12"></path><path d="M5.5 4.5h.01"></path></svg></span>
            <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="min-w-0 flex-1">
              <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2"><span data-v-c47154f1="" class="hex-text-e7e5e4 font-mono text-[0.92rem] font-bold">Antigravity</span>
                <!--v-if-->
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p data-v-c47154f1="" class="hex-text-a7a39c mb-4 min-h-[2.5rem] font-mono text-[0.66rem] leading-[1.6]">Google's agentic IDE (VS Code-based) — the full neon editor theme.</p>
          <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="mb-3 flex gap-2"><a data-v-c47154f1="" href="/grimicorn-neon-themes/antigravity/grimicorn-neon-antigravity.color-theme.json" download="grimicorn-neon-antigravity.color-theme.json" class="n-file inline-flex min-w-[88px] flex-1 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 rounded-[2px] border px-2 py-2 text-center font-mono text-[0.66rem] no-underline"><svg data-v-c47154f1="" width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
                <path data-v-c47154f1="" d="M6 1v7M6 8L3.5 5.5M6 8l2.5-2.5M2 10.5h8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
              </svg> Neon</a></div>
          <details data-v-c47154f1="" class="mt-auto">
            <summary data-v-c47154f1="" class="n-summary hex-text-75726b cursor-pointer font-mono text-[0.6rem]"><span data-v-c47154f1="" class="n-chevron inline-block">▸</span> install </summary>
            <p data-v-c47154f1="" class="hex-text-a7a39c mt-2 font-mono text-[0.62rem] leading-[1.7]">Load it like any VS Code theme — a folder with a package.json in Antigravity's extensions directory — then pick Grimicorn Neon.</p><a data-v-c47154f1="" href="https://antigravity.google/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="n-link mt-2 inline-block font-mono text-[0.6rem]">docs →</a>
          </details>
        </div>
        <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="n-card group flex flex-col border-t-2 pt-5 hex-border-1c1c20">
          <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="mb-2 flex items-start gap-3"><span data-v-c47154f1="" class="n-icon mt-0.5 shrink-0"><svg data-v-c47154f1="" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 3h12v10H3z"></path><path d="M3 6h12"></path><path d="M5.5 4.5h.01"></path></svg></span>
            <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="min-w-0 flex-1">
              <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2"><span data-v-c47154f1="" class="hex-text-e7e5e4 font-mono text-[0.92rem] font-bold">Cursor</span>
                <!--v-if-->
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p data-v-c47154f1="" class="hex-text-a7a39c mb-4 min-h-[2.5rem] font-mono text-[0.66rem] leading-[1.6]">AI-first VS Code fork — the same neon editor + workbench theme.</p>
          <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="mb-3 flex gap-2"><a data-v-c47154f1="" href="/grimicorn-neon-themes/cursor/grimicorn-neon-cursor.color-theme.json" download="grimicorn-neon-cursor.color-theme.json" class="n-file inline-flex min-w-[88px] flex-1 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 rounded-[2px] border px-2 py-2 text-center font-mono text-[0.66rem] no-underline"><svg data-v-c47154f1="" width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
                <path data-v-c47154f1="" d="M6 1v7M6 8L3.5 5.5M6 8l2.5-2.5M2 10.5h8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
              </svg> Neon</a></div>
          <details data-v-c47154f1="" class="mt-auto">
            <summary data-v-c47154f1="" class="n-summary hex-text-75726b cursor-pointer font-mono text-[0.6rem]"><span data-v-c47154f1="" class="n-chevron inline-block">▸</span> install </summary>
            <p data-v-c47154f1="" class="hex-text-a7a39c mt-2 font-mono text-[0.62rem] leading-[1.7]">Drop the file into a folder with a package.json under <code>~/.cursor/extensions/grimicorn-neon/</code>, reload, then pick Grimicorn Neon in <code>⌘K ⌘T</code>.</p><a data-v-c47154f1="" href="https://docs.cursor.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="n-link mt-2 inline-block font-mono text-[0.6rem]">docs →</a>
