              </svg> Neon</a></div>
          <details data-v-c47154f1="" class="mt-auto">
            <summary data-v-c47154f1="" class="n-summary hex-text-75726b cursor-pointer font-mono text-[0.6rem]"><span data-v-c47154f1="" class="n-chevron inline-block">▸</span> install </summary>
            <p data-v-c47154f1="" class="hex-text-a7a39c mt-2 font-mono text-[0.62rem] leading-[1.7]">Devin's workspace runs a VS Code editor — load it as a VS Code color theme, then select Grimicorn Neon.</p><a data-v-c47154f1="" href="https://docs.devin.ai/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="n-link mt-2 inline-block font-mono text-[0.6rem]">docs →</a>
