          <p data-v-c47154f1="" class="hex-text-a7a39c mb-4 min-h-[2.5rem] font-mono text-[0.66rem] leading-[1.6]">Color preset for the macOS terminal favorite.</p>
          <div data-v-c47154f1="" class="mb-3 flex gap-2"><a data-v-c47154f1="" href="/grimicorn-neon-themes/iterm/Grimicorn-Neon.itermcolors" download="Grimicorn-Neon.itermcolors" class="n-file inline-flex min-w-[88px] flex-1 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 rounded-[2px] border px-2 py-2 text-center font-mono text-[0.66rem] no-underline"><svg data-v-c47154f1="" width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
                <path data-v-c47154f1="" d="M6 1v7M6 8L3.5 5.5M6 8l2.5-2.5M2 10.5h8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
              </svg> Neon</a></div>
          <details data-v-c47154f1="" class="mt-auto">
            <summary data-v-c47154f1="" class="n-summary hex-text-75726b cursor-pointer font-mono text-[0.6rem]"><span data-v-c47154f1="" class="n-chevron inline-block">▸</span> install </summary>
            <p data-v-c47154f1="" class="hex-text-a7a39c mt-2 font-mono text-[0.62rem] leading-[1.7]">Settings → Profiles → Colors → <em>Color Presets…</em> → <em>Import</em>, then select the preset.</p><a data-v-c47154f1="" href="https://iterm2.com/documentation-preferences-profiles-colors.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="n-link mt-2 inline-block font-mono text-[0.6rem]">docs →</a>
