            <p data-v-c47154f1="" class="hex-text-a7a39c mt-2 font-mono text-[0.62rem] leading-[1.7]">Double-click the file (or Settings → Profiles → ⚙︎ → <em>Import</em>), then set as default.</p><a data-v-c47154f1="" href="https://support.apple.com/guide/terminal/change-profiles-color-trml1067/mac" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="n-link mt-2 inline-block font-mono text-[0.6rem]">docs →</a>
