            <p data-v-c47154f1="" class="hex-text-a7a39c mt-2 font-mono text-[0.62rem] leading-[1.7]">Copy the file into <code>~/.warp/themes/</code>, then Settings → Appearance → Themes → <em>Grimicorn Neon</em>.</p><a data-v-c47154f1="" href="https://docs.warp.dev/terminal/appearance/custom-themes" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="n-link mt-2 inline-block font-mono text-[0.6rem]">docs →</a>
          </details>
